{"id":"2026-10-20-design-how-first-principles-thinking","date":"2026-10-20","topic":"design","region":"americas","headline":"How First Principles Thinking Led to SpaceX","source":{"name":"Wikipedia","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/SpaceX"},"accent":"uk","tiers":{"t1":{"sentences":[{"text":"In 2001, Elon Musk wanted to buy a rocket.","voice":"voice/2026-10-20-design-how-first-principles-thinking/t1-0.m4a","roles":["M","M","S","S","V","O","O","O","O"],"dur":4.46,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-10-20-design-how-first-principles-thinking/ja/t1-0.m4a","durJa":4.76,"times":[0.0,0.22,1.78,2.12,2.5,2.92,3.2,3.42,3.68]},{"text":"The prices for these large machines were very high.","voice":"voice/2026-10-20-design-how-first-principles-thinking/t1-1.m4a","roles":["S","S","S","S","S","S","V","C","C"],"dur":3.09,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-10-20-design-how-first-principles-thinking/ja/t1-1.m4a","durJa":3.66,"times":[0.0,0.04,0.28,0.72,0.88,1.2,1.7,2.12,2.42]},{"text":"He looked at the price of their basic materials.","voice":"voice/2026-10-20-design-how-first-principles-thinking/t1-2.m4a","roles":["S","V","V","O","O","O","O","O","O"],"dur":2.78,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-10-20-design-how-first-principles-thinking/ja/t1-2.m4a","durJa":3.75,"times":[0.0,0.06,0.24,0.44,0.54,0.82,1.16,1.3,1.64]},{"text":"These basic materials cost only a small amount of money.","voice":"voice/2026-10-20-design-how-first-principles-thinking/t1-3.m4a","roles":["S","S","S","V","O","O","O","O","O","O"],"dur":3.56,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-10-20-design-how-first-principles-thinking/ja/t1-3.m4a","durJa":3.89,"times":[0.0,0.2,0.6,1.12,1.64,2.04,2.24,2.52,2.82,3.08]},{"text":"So he started his own rocket company in 2002.","voice":"voice/2026-10-20-design-how-first-principles-thinking/t1-4.m4a","roles":["M","S","V","O","O","O","O","M","M"],"dur":4.14,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-10-20-design-how-first-principles-thinking/ja/t1-4.m4a","durJa":5.04,"times":[0.0,0.14,0.28,0.6,0.94,1.2,1.5,1.96,2.42]}],"bands":{"core1000":95,"core1800":0,"ngsl":0,"tsl":0,"nawl":0,"beyond":5},"grammar":[{"i":0,"focus":"wanted to buy","title":"Infinitive as Verb Object","note":"The main verb 'wanted' takes 'to buy' as its object to show an intended action. When verbs like 'want' express a desire for an action, we use the 'to + verb' infinitive."},{"i":1,"focus":"were very high","title":"Subject Complement with Linking Verb","note":"The linking verb 'were' connects the subject to the adjective 'very high'. This structure describes the quality or state of the subject."}]},"t2":{"sentences":[{"text":"In the early 2000s, Elon Musk wanted to buy a rocket.","voice":"voice/2026-10-20-design-how-first-principles-thinking/t2-0.m4a","roles":["M","M","M","M","S","S","V","O","O","O","O"],"dur":4.7,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-10-20-design-how-first-principles-thinking/ja/t2-0.m4a","durJa":5.14,"times":[0.0,0.2,0.32,0.64,1.94,2.28,2.66,3.12,3.44,3.68,3.96]},{"text":"But existing rocket sellers asked for prices that were very high.","voice":"voice/2026-10-20-design-how-first-principles-thinking/t2-1.m4a","roles":["M","S","S","S","V","V","O","O","O","O","O"],"dur":4.14,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-10-20-design-how-first-principles-thinking/ja/t2-1.m4a","durJa":4.91,"times":[0.0,0.1,0.46,0.96,1.34,1.88,2.18,2.52,2.94,3.12,3.48]},{"text":"So he decided to look at the raw materials instead.","voice":"voice/2026-10-20-design-how-first-principles-thinking/t2-2.m4a","roles":["M","S","V","O","O","O","O","O","O","M"],"dur":3.52,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-10-20-design-how-first-principles-thinking/ja/t2-2.m4a","durJa":3.96,"times":[0.0,0.16,0.44,0.78,1.1,1.32,1.5,1.62,1.84,2.38]},{"text":"He learned that these basic materials cost only a tiny amount.","voice":"voice/2026-10-20-design-how-first-principles-thinking/t2-3.m4a","roles":["S","V","O","O","O","O","O","O","O","O","O"],"dur":4.19,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-10-20-design-how-first-principles-thinking/ja/t2-3.m4a","durJa":5.18,"times":[0.0,0.1,0.36,0.62,0.84,1.3,1.8,2.32,2.8,3.02,3.36]},{"text":"So Musk chose to make his own cheap rockets from scratch.","voice":"voice/2026-10-20-design-how-first-principles-thinking/t2-4.m4a","roles":["M","S","V","O","O","O","O","O","O","M","M"],"dur":3.95,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-10-20-design-how-first-principles-thinking/ja/t2-4.m4a","durJa":4.43,"times":[0.0,0.18,0.5,0.92,1.16,1.34,1.56,1.82,2.16,2.64,3.12]},{"text":"Because of this idea, he started the company SpaceX in 2002.","voice":"voice/2026-10-20-design-how-first-principles-thinking/t2-5.m4a","roles":["M","M","M","M","S","V","O","O","O","M","M"],"dur":5.24,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-10-20-design-how-first-principles-thinking/ja/t2-5.m4a","durJa":5.69,"times":[0.0,0.18,0.34,0.48,1.38,1.5,1.88,2.04,2.36,2.84,3.6]}],"bands":{"core1000":86,"core1800":3,"ngsl":2,"tsl":2,"nawl":0,"beyond":7},"grammar":[{"i":3,"focus":"learned that these basic materials cost","title":"Noun Clause with That","note":"The word 'that' introduces a complete clause serving as the object of 'learned'. It expresses the specific piece of information or fact that was discovered."},{"i":4,"focus":"from scratch","title":"Idiomatic Prepositional Phrase","note":"The expression 'from scratch' means doing something from the very beginning using raw elements. Here, it indicates creating rockets without pre-made parts."}]},"t3":{"sentences":[{"text":"In the early 2000s, Elon Musk wanted to buy a space rocket.","voice":"voice/2026-10-20-design-how-first-principles-thinking/t3-0.m4a","roles":["M","M","M","M","S","S","V","O","O","O","O","O"],"dur":4.67,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-10-20-design-how-first-principles-thinking/ja/t3-0.m4a","durJa":6.43,"times":[0.0,0.24,0.38,0.7,1.86,2.12,2.48,2.88,3.2,3.42,3.68,3.92]},{"text":"However, he found that existing aerospace companies charged prices that were surprisingly high.","voice":"voice/2026-10-20-design-how-first-principles-thinking/t3-1.m4a","roles":["M","S","V","O","O","O","O","O","O","O","O","O","O"],"dur":5.94,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-10-20-design-how-first-principles-thinking/ja/t3-1.m4a","durJa":6.67,"times":[0.0,0.62,0.74,1.02,1.26,1.68,2.16,2.88,3.42,3.94,4.36,4.56,5.22]},{"text":"To solve this, Musk used first-principles thinking, which breaks complex things down into basic truths.","voice":"voice/2026-10-20-design-how-first-principles-thinking/t3-2.m4a","roles":["M","M","M","S","V","O","O","O","O","O","O","O","O","O","O"],"dur":7.03,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-10-20-design-how-first-principles-thinking/ja/t3-2.m4a","durJa":11.61,"times":[0.0,0.08,0.28,1.18,1.24,1.6,2.84,3.84,3.94,4.22,4.62,5.12,5.42,5.82,6.08]},{"text":"He calculated the total cost of all the raw materials needed for a rocket.","voice":"voice/2026-10-20-design-how-first-principles-thinking/t3-3.m4a","roles":["S","V","O","O","O","O","O","O","O","O","O","O","O","O"],"dur":4.34,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-10-20-design-how-first-principles-thinking/ja/t3-3.m4a","durJa":5.12,"times":[0.0,0.1,0.5,0.88,1.12,1.54,1.78,2.02,2.16,2.38,2.84,3.4,3.7,3.8]},{"text":"His calculation showed that these raw materials cost only a small share of the price.","voice":"voice/2026-10-20-design-how-first-principles-thinking/t3-4.m4a","roles":["S","S","V","O","O","O","O","O","O","O","O","O","O","O","O"],"dur":4.81,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-10-20-design-how-first-principles-thinking/ja/t3-4.m4a","durJa":6.3,"times":[0.0,0.08,0.4,0.98,1.3,1.52,1.74,2.18,2.64,3.06,3.2,3.48,3.86,4.14,4.24]},{"text":"He realized that he could build his own rockets for much less money.","voice":"voice/2026-10-20-design-how-first-principles-thinking/t3-5.m4a","roles":["S","V","O","O","O","O","O","O","O","O","O","O","O"],"dur":3.77,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-10-20-design-how-first-principles-thinking/ja/t3-5.m4a","durJa":5.34,"times":[0.0,0.06,0.34,0.78,0.96,1.12,1.38,1.62,1.9,2.2,2.68,2.92,3.24]},{"text":"Consequently, Musk founded his own space company called SpaceX in 2002.","voice":"voice/2026-10-20-design-how-first-principles-thinking/t3-6.m4a","roles":["M","S","V","O","O","O","O","O","O","M","M"],"dur":6.05,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-10-20-design-how-first-principles-thinking/ja/t3-6.m4a","durJa":6.65,"times":[0.0,1.02,1.14,1.62,1.9,2.16,2.44,2.88,3.48,3.88,4.6]}],"bands":{"core1000":82,"core1800":5,"ngsl":7,"tsl":1,"nawl":0,"beyond":5},"grammar":[{"i":2,"focus":", which breaks complex things down","title":"Non-defining Relative Clause","note":"A comma followed by 'which' introduces non-essential extra detail about 'first-principles thinking'. It clarifies how the method works without changing the main sentence structure."},{"i":6,"focus":"called SpaceX","title":"Past Participle as Post-modifier","note":"The past participle phrase 'called SpaceX' describes the preceding noun 'company'. It acts as a shortened relative clause equivalent to 'which was called SpaceX'."}]},"t4":{"sentences":[{"text":"In the early 2000s, Elon Musk explored options to buy a rocket for a space project.","voice":"voice/2026-10-20-design-how-first-principles-thinking/t4-0.m4a","roles":["M","M","M","M","S","S","V","O","O","O","O","O","O","O","O","O"],"dur":5.91,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-10-20-design-how-first-principles-thinking/ja/t4-0.m4a","durJa":7.62,"times":[0.0,0.2,0.32,0.64,1.82,2.08,2.42,3.0,3.36,3.78,3.94,4.1,4.38,4.78,4.9,5.08]},{"text":"He soon realized that commercial space vehicles were priced at extraordinarily high and prohibitive levels.","voice":"voice/2026-10-20-design-how-first-principles-thinking/t4-1.m4a","roles":["S","M","V","O","O","O","O","O","O","O","O","O","O","O","O"],"dur":6.43,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-10-20-design-how-first-principles-thinking/ja/t4-1.m4a","durJa":7.18,"times":[0.0,0.04,0.2,0.64,1.04,1.42,1.96,2.36,2.78,3.06,3.38,4.08,4.68,5.08,5.68]},{"text":"To address this issue, Musk applied first-principles thinking, a method where problems are reduced to fundamental facts.","voice":"voice/2026-10-20-design-how-first-principles-thinking/t4-2.m4a","roles":["M","M","M","M","S","V","O","O","O","O","O","O","O","O","O","O","O"],"dur":7.99,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-10-20-design-how-first-principles-thinking/ja/t4-2.m4a","durJa":10.37,"times":[0.0,0.08,0.24,0.54,1.5,1.56,2.08,3.18,4.4,4.44,4.72,5.02,5.4,5.76,6.04,6.54,6.96]},{"text":"A rocket was mentally broken down by Musk into its basic raw materials.","voice":"voice/2026-10-20-design-how-first-principles-thinking/t4-3.m4a","roles":["S","S","V","M","V","V","M","M","M","M","M","M","M"],"dur":4.83,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-10-20-design-how-first-principles-thinking/ja/t4-3.m4a","durJa":5.44,"times":[0.0,0.04,0.32,0.7,1.14,1.58,1.96,2.2,2.54,2.86,3.08,3.48,3.86]},{"text":"He discovered that the combined value of these raw materials was only a small fraction of the retail price.","voice":"voice/2026-10-20-design-how-first-principles-thinking/t4-4.m4a","roles":["S","V","O","O","O","O","O","O","O","O","O","O","O","O","O","O","O","O","O"],"dur":6.17,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-10-20-design-how-first-principles-thinking/ja/t4-4.m4a","durJa":6.69,"times":[0.0,0.04,0.34,0.72,0.82,1.18,1.84,2.04,2.22,2.42,2.8,3.32,3.66,3.84,4.14,4.66,5.04,5.16,5.38]},{"text":"It was reported that the massive price markup came from traditional manufacturing practices rather than material costs.","voice":"voice/2026-10-20-design-how-first-principles-thinking/t4-5.m4a","roles":["S","V","V","S","S","S","S","S","S","S","S","S","S","S","S","S","S"],"dur":7.18,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-10-20-design-how-first-principles-thinking/ja/t4-5.m4a","durJa":6.72,"times":[0.0,0.06,0.16,0.5,0.9,1.02,1.38,1.78,2.32,2.82,3.06,3.42,4.0,4.96,5.64,5.96,6.28]},{"text":"Convinced that rocket production could be made far cheaper, Musk resolved to build his own spacecraft.","voice":"voice/2026-10-20-design-how-first-principles-thinking/t4-6.m4a","roles":["M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","S","V","O","O","O","O","O"],"dur":6.05,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-10-20-design-how-first-principles-thinking/ja/t4-6.m4a","durJa":7.27,"times":[0.0,0.46,0.62,0.82,1.42,1.66,1.78,1.96,2.34,3.44,3.54,4.02,4.36,4.56,4.8,5.06]},{"text":"This realization directly prompted him to establish the space company SpaceX in 2002.","voice":"voice/2026-10-20-design-how-first-principles-thinking/t4-7.m4a","roles":["S","S","M","V","O","C","C","C","C","C","C","C","C"],"dur":6.31,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-10-20-design-how-first-principles-thinking/ja/t4-7.m4a","durJa":7.45,"times":[0.0,0.12,0.38,1.26,1.7,2.06,2.24,2.62,2.9,3.12,3.54,4.0,4.62]}],"bands":{"core1000":78,"core1800":9,"ngsl":5,"tsl":0,"nawl":1,"beyond":7},"grammar":[{"i":3,"focus":"was mentally broken down","title":"Passive Voice with Adverb","note":"The passive form 'was broken down' focuses attention on the rocket being analyzed. Placing the adverb 'mentally' inside the verb phrase specifies the manner of the action."},{"i":5,"focus":"It was reported that","title":"Dummy Subject It Extraposition","note":"The word 'It' acts as an introductory placeholder, placing the longer 'that'-clause at the end. This structure creates formal style and maintains balance in English sentences."}]},"t5":{"sentences":[{"text":"When Elon Musk attempted to purchase space rockets in the early 2000s, he encountered extremely high price tags.","voice":"voice/2026-10-20-design-how-first-principles-thinking/t5-0.m4a","roles":["M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","S","V","O","O","O","O"],"dur":7.84,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-10-20-design-how-first-principles-thinking/ja/t5-0.m4a","durJa":8.74,"times":[0.0,0.3,0.58,1.06,1.44,1.88,2.24,2.54,2.92,3.32,3.42,3.64,4.9,5.06,5.42,6.1,6.72,7.08]},{"text":"Instead of accepting those high prices, he turned to first-principles thinking, a problem-solving strategy that reduces systems to fundamental components.","voice":"voice/2026-10-20-design-how-first-principles-thinking/t5-1.m4a","roles":["M","M","M","M","M","M","S","V","V","O","O","O","O","O","O","O","O","O","O","O"],"dur":9.72,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-10-20-design-how-first-principles-thinking/ja/t5-1.m4a","durJa":10.02,"times":[0.0,0.28,0.46,0.98,1.28,1.5,2.5,2.58,2.82,2.99,3.96,5.08,5.16,5.78,6.3,6.66,7.02,7.6,8.08,8.5]},{"text":"Musk calculated the actual cost of the basic raw materials required to construct a full rocket.","voice":"voice/2026-10-20-design-how-first-principles-thinking/t5-2.m4a","roles":["S","V","O","O","O","O","O","O","O","O","O","O","O","O","O","O"],"dur":6.33,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-10-20-design-how-first-principles-thinking/ja/t5-2.m4a","durJa":6.4,"times":[0.0,0.2,0.86,1.22,1.46,2.14,2.38,2.5,2.86,3.18,3.8,4.28,4.58,4.88,5.2,5.44]},{"text":"To his surprise, these raw materials accounted for only a tiny fraction of the rocket's overall price.","voice":"voice/2026-10-20-design-how-first-principles-thinking/t5-3.m4a","roles":["M","M","M","S","S","S","V","V","O","O","O","O","O","O","O","O","O"],"dur":6.5,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-10-20-design-how-first-principles-thinking/ja/t5-3.m4a","durJa":6.83,"times":[0.0,0.06,0.18,1.22,1.42,1.62,2.12,2.58,3.0,3.3,3.48,3.8,4.34,4.76,4.84,5.3,5.62]},{"text":"This large price difference showed that traditional aerospace manufacturing added immense cost beyond the physical components.","voice":"voice/2026-10-20-design-how-first-principles-thinking/t5-4.m4a","roles":["S","S","S","S","V","O","O","O","O","O","O","O","O","O","O","O"],"dur":7.44,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-10-20-design-how-first-principles-thinking/ja/t5-4.m4a","durJa":8.4,"times":[0.0,0.18,0.42,0.8,1.2,1.64,1.92,2.32,2.76,3.8,4.46,4.88,5.44,5.9,6.26,6.52]},{"text":"Recognizing that high expenses were the result of industry habit rather than material costs, Musk chose to act independently.","voice":"voice/2026-10-20-design-how-first-principles-thinking/t5-5.m4a","roles":["M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","S","V","O","O","O"],"dur":7.45,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-10-20-design-how-first-principles-thinking/ja/t5-5.m4a","durJa":8.42,"times":[0.0,0.58,0.8,1.02,1.56,1.96,2.04,2.34,2.52,2.82,3.42,3.74,4.02,4.38,5.32,5.52,5.96,6.18,6.4]},{"text":"By manufacturing vehicles himself, he believed he could drastically lower launch costs and streamline production.","voice":"voice/2026-10-20-design-how-first-principles-thinking/t5-6.m4a","roles":["M","M","M","M","S","V","O","O","O","O","O","O","O","O","O"],"dur":6.33,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-10-20-design-how-first-principles-thinking/ja/t5-6.m4a","durJa":7.14,"times":[0.0,0.14,0.5,1.08,2.26,2.34,2.58,2.84,3.0,3.38,3.98,4.26,4.64,5.02,5.56]},{"text":"This key insight led directly to the founding of SpaceX in 2002, transforming how modern space travel is approached.","voice":"voice/2026-10-20-design-how-first-principles-thinking/t5-7.m4a","roles":["S","S","S","V","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M"],"dur":7.89,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-10-20-design-how-first-principles-thinking/ja/t5-7.m4a","durJa":9.33,"times":[0.0,0.16,0.42,0.82,1.24,1.6,1.98,2.06,2.36,2.62,2.86,3.42,4.66,5.3,5.66,5.92,6.28,6.58,6.9]}],"bands":{"core1000":74,"core1800":12,"ngsl":7,"tsl":2,"nawl":1,"beyond":4},"grammar":[{"i":0,"focus":"When Elon Musk attempted","title":"Adverbial Time Clause","note":"The subordinating conjunction 'When' starts a time clause that establishes the timeframe for the main clause. It sets up the situation before describing what happened next."},{"i":5,"focus":"Recognizing that high expenses were","title":"Participle Clause for Reason","note":"An '-ing' participle phrase at the sentence start acts as an adverbial modifier explaining cause or background. It concisely links Musk's realization directly to his choice to act."}]}},"glossary":[{"word":"aerospace","lemma":"aerospace","pos":"noun","ipa":"/ˈɛr.oʊˌspeɪs/","definition":"the industry that builds aircraft and spacecraft","tiers":["t3","t5"]},{"word":"first-principles","lemma":"first principle","pos":"noun","ipa":"/ˌfɜːrst ˈprɪn.sə.pəlz/","definition":"basic facts or truths that cannot be deduced further","tiers":["t3","t4","t5"]},{"word":"prohibitive","lemma":"prohibitive","pos":"adjective","ipa":"/proʊˈhɪb.ə.tɪv/","definition":"so high that it prevents buying something","tiers":["t4"]},{"word":"markup","lemma":"markup","pos":"noun","ipa":"/ˈmɑːrk.ʌp/","definitio